<p><b>Balance Transfers </b><span><b>25.00% Fixed APR </b></span></p>
<p><span><b>Penalty Rate </b></span>FACEBANK will not apply a penalty rate charge (APR) to the Credit Card product</p>
<p><span><b>How to Avoid Paying Interest on Purchases </b></span>The due date for each payment is at least 25 days after the end of each billing cycle. No interest will be charged on Purchases in billing periods where there is no previous balance, provided the full balance of the account, including purchases made during the period, is paid or credited on or before the applicable payment due date. If you pay the full balance due, on or before the monthly payment due date, no interest will be charged on Purchases made. For Cash Advances and Balance Transfers, interest will accrue from the date the transaction is made.</p>
<p><span><b>For Federal Reserve Board Credit Card Recommendations </b></span>To learn more about factors to consider when applying for or using a credit card, visit the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau’s page.<br>
<a href="https://www.consumerfinance.gov/data-research/credit-card-data/"><span>https://www.consumerfinance.gov/data-research/credit-card-data/</span></a></p>
<p><b>Other Charges</b></p>
<p><b>Membership Fee $95.00 </b>Annual Fee,<b> $45.00 </b>Additional Card Fee (if applicable). The first year, the Annual Membership Fee is waived.</p>
<p><span><b>International Transaction Fee </b></span><b>3% </b>of the amount of each transaction in dollars</p>
<p><span><b>Cash Advance Fee </b></span><b>3%</b> of the amount of each transaction <b>(minimum of $2, maximum of $50)</b></p>
<p><span><b>Late Payment Fee </b></span>Up to <b>$35.00</b> for payments received after the billing cycle closing date</p>
<p>
</p>
